=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ LESS @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt less @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt less is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later; see COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [LESS.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for less
    At system startup: to define LESS$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:LESS$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @LESS$ROOT:[000000]LESS$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE LESS removes the product and deassigns LESS$ROOT.
